---
import TacticalBackground from "@/components/TacticalBackground.astro"

const organizerFeatures = ["Menos trabajo manual", "Información centralizada", "Publicación inmediata", "Consulta pública"]
---

<section id="organizadores" class="relative overflow-hidden bg-[#e8eeec] py-24 text-[#081313] md:py-32">
  <TacticalBackground variant="sheet" align="left" />
  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-[1280px] px-6 md:px-8 lg:px-12">
    <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr] lg:items-end">
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[#146d76]">03 / Para organizadores</p>
        <h2 class="mt-5 font-display text-3xl leading-tight md:text-5xl">Menos administración.<br /><span class="text-[#167984]">Más fútbol.</span></h2>
      </div>
      <p class="max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed text-[#405554] lg:justify-self-end">Tenka convierte el trabajo diario del organizador en información útil para capitanes, jugadores y aficionados, sin cadenas interminables de mensajes.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-[1.25fr_0.75fr]">
      <article class="relative overflow-hidden bg-[#0d1b1b] p-6 text-white md:p-9">
        <div class="absolute right-0 top-0 h-full w-1/2 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_top_right,rgba(77,208,225,.18),transparent_62%)]" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="relative grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-[0.82fr_1.18fr]">
          <div>
            <span class="inline-flex border border-cyan/30 px-3 py-1 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-cyan">Organizador</span>
            <h3 class="mt-6 font-display text-3xl">Tu liga bajo control</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">Gestiona desde la programación inicial hasta la final desde una sola plataforma.</p>
            <ul class="mt-7 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
              {organizerFeatures.map((feature, index) => <li class="border-l border-cyan/40 pl-3 text-xs text-text-secondary"><span class="mr-2 font-brand text-cyan">0{index + 1}</span>{feature}</li>)}
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="border border-white/10 bg-[#111f20] p-4">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 pb-3"><div><p class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-cyan">Primera A</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold">Panel de división</p></div><span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-success"></span></div>
            <div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 text-center"><div class="bg-white/5 p-3"><strong class="block font-display text-xl">8</strong><span class="text-[9px] text-text-muted">Equipos</span></div><div class="bg-white/5 p-3"><strong class="block font-display text-xl">6</strong><span class="text-[9px] text-text-muted">Jornadas</span></div><div class="bg-cyan/10 p-3"><strong class="block font-display text-xl text-cyan">24</strong><span class="text-[9px] text-text-muted">Partidos</span></div></div>
            <div class="mt-3 flex items-center justify-between border border-cyan/20 bg-cyan/[.06] p-3 text-xs"><span>Jornada 07 lista</span><span class="text-cyan">Publicar →</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-1">
        <article class="border border-[#b9c8c4] bg-[#f4f7f5]/90 p-6">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between"><span class="text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#167984]">Capitán</span><span class="font-brand text-3xl text-[#0b2929]/10">C</span></div>
          <h3 class="mt-8 font-display text-xl">Equipos informados</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#526564]">Los capitanes consultan plantillas, invitaciones y próximos partidos.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="border border-[#b9c8c4] bg-[#dce8e5]/90 p-6">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between"><span class="text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#167984]">Aficionado</span><span class="font-brand text-3xl text-[#0b2929]/10">A</span></div>
          <h3 class="mt-8 font-display text-xl">Información pública</h3>
          <div class="mt-4 flex items-center gap-3 border border-[#aabdb9] bg-white/60 px-3 py-2 text-xs text-[#647674]"><span>⌕</span><span>Liga, equipo o jugador...</span></div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
